There is no proof point

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:11.123
to prove that he couldn't do it.

00:08:11.123 --> 00:08:12.091
So I'm going to build a wall

00:08:12.091 --> 00:08:13.626
across the entire border of Mexico.

00:08:13.626 --> 00:08:14.894
Mexico's going to pay for it.

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:15.628
Well, I don't think he's

00:08:15.628 --> 00:08:17.563
going to be able to do that.

00:08:17.563 --> 00:08:20.099
Physically figure out a way to do it.

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:21.901
But how can you prove that he wouldn't?

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:23.402
This is different today.

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:24.770
We know he said he would build a wall

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.205
across the entire border, Mexico.

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:26.739
He didn't do it.

00:08:26.739 --> 00:08:28.174
About a quarter of the wall was built.

00:08:28.174 --> 00:08:29.408
He said Mexico would pay for it.

00:08:29.408 --> 00:08:31.410
We haven't gotten our first peso

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.812
and we know a lot of other things.

00:08:32.812 --> 00:08:33.579
So he was going to repeal

00:08:33.579 --> 00:08:35.014
and replace Obamacare.

00:08:35.014 --> 00:08:36.048
He had a Republican Congress

00:08:36.048 --> 00:08:37.617
for two years, didn't get it done.

00:08:37.617 --> 00:08:38.751
Said he was going to balance the budget

00:08:38.751 --> 00:08:39.285
in four years,

00:08:39.285 --> 00:08:40.786
left with the greatest deficit

00:08:40.786 --> 00:08:42.488
of any president in modern history.

00:08:42.488 --> 00:08:43.789
Said he was going to

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:45.391
get rid of the national debt

00:08:45.391 --> 00:08:46.325
in eight years.

00:08:46.325 --> 00:08:47.593
And left it trillions

00:08:47.593 --> 00:08:48.995
higher than when he walked in the door

00:08:48.995 --> 00:08:50.296
in just four years.

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:51.931
There is a record here, Jake,

00:08:51.931 --> 00:08:53.032
on things, both very,

00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:55.067
very significant on public policy.

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:56.702
But even on the trivial.

00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:57.103
Remember,

00:08:57.103 --> 00:08:58.905
he used to go after Barack Obama

00:08:58.905 --> 00:09:00.273
for playing golf.

00:09:00.273 --> 00:09:00.673
And I remember

00:09:00.673 --> 00:09:02.174
standing on the debate stage one time.

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:03.409
He looked in the camera and said,

00:09:03.409 --> 00:09:05.611
I will not play golf a day

00:09:06.178 --> 00:09:07.346
because I'll be so busy

00:09:07.346 --> 00:09:09.015
fixing all of America's problems.

00:09:09.015 --> 00:09:11.083
And he wanted to play golf for 260 days.

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:13.653
So problems promises both big and small.

00:09:13.653 --> 00:09:14.720
He broke them.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.222
He disappointed our party.

00:09:16.222 --> 00:09:17.790
He disappointed the country.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:18.891
And that's going to be

00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.359
the focus of this campaign.

00:09:20.359 --> 00:09:21.627
I have a lot more to ask you about.

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:21.994
Are going to have to.

